  "metadata": {
    "send_date": "1926-08-13",
    "letter_title": "Petition for Environmental Protection",
    "sender_persons": ["Lisa Simpson"],
    "receiver_persons": ["Mayor Joe Quimby", "Seymour Skinner"],
  },
  "content": "Dear Mayor Quimby and Mr. Skinner,\n\nWe, the undersigned, hereby submit a petition for the protection of our environment. We are gravely concerned about the increasing pollution in our city and the adverse effects it has on our health and well-being. We urge you to take immediate action to address this issue by implementing stricter regulations on industrial emissions and waste disposal. Furthermore, we request the establishment of more green spaces and parks to improve air quality and provide recreational areas for our citizens. We believe that a clean and healthy environment is essential for the prosperity and happiness of our community. Thank you for your attention to this matter. Sincerely,\n\nLisa Simpson"
}

